<section class="section" id="config">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker">Configuration</span>
      <h2>One file tells Marshal everything it needs.</h2>
      <p>Sample configuration, shown for illustration — the shape your actual <code>marshal.config.yml</code> would take for a typical project.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="config-grid">
      <div class="config-panel">
        <div class="config-head"><span>marshal.config.yml</span></div>
        <pre><span class="k">git</span>:
  <span class="k">host</span>: github
  <span class="k">repo</span>: acme/storefront
  <span class="k">default_branch</span>: main
  <span class="k">push_mode</span>: pull_request

<span class="k">test</span>:
  <span class="k">command</span>: npm test
  <span class="k">required</span>: true

<span class="k">deploy</span>:
  <span class="k">target</span>: vercel
  <span class="k">project</span>: storefront-prod
  <span class="k">on</span>: tests_passed

<span class="k">audit</span>:
  <span class="k">log_to</span>: ./.marshal/audit.log</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="config-notes">
        <div class="config-note">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <div>
            <h4>push_mode</h4>
            <p>Choose <code>pull_request</code> for review-before-merge, or <code>direct</code> when a branch is meant to ship straight through.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="config-note">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <div>
            <h4>test.required</h4>
            <p>When true, a failing or missing test run blocks the deploy step outright — the assistant gets the failure back, not a shipped bug.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="config-note">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <div>
            <h4>deploy.on</h4>
            <p>Gate deploys on <code>tests_passed</code>, or set <code>manual</code> to require a human approval regardless of test outcome.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">Marshal is currently in private beta. The config shape above reflects the current design and may still change before general release.</p>
  </div>
</section>

